port x11/libxshmfence
type port
reason "DragonFly umtx futex backend: PROCESS_SHARED pthread primitives do not work cross-process on DragonFly, so the pthread fence backend never wakes remote waiters and X can crash on fence teardown; DRI3, Vulkan WSI and Xwayland all need cross-process xshmfence"
target @any

mk add CONFIGURE_ARGS "--enable-futex"
file materialize dragonfly/patch-src_xshmfence__futex.h -> dragonfly/patch-src_xshmfence__futex.h
